       *  @param  __args Constructor arguments.
       *
       *  Calls `__a.construct(__p, std::forward<_Args>(__args)...)`
       *  in C++11, C++14 and C++17. Changed in C++20 to call
       *  `std::construct_at(__p, std::forward<_Args>(__args)...)` instead.
